              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mnamo siku ya kwanza ya mwezi wa tatu, mwaka wa kumi na moja tangu uhamisho wetu, neno la Mwenyezi-Mungu lilinijia: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wewe mtu! Mwambie hivi Farao mfalme wa Misri na watu wake wote:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kwa hiyo, mimi Bwana Mwenyezi-Mungu nasema hivi: Kwa sababu wewe ulirefusha",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31:10",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kwa … ulirefusha:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Au Kwa sababu wewe ulirefusha.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kimo chake na kukiinua kilele chake kati ya matawi makubwa, ukajivunia urefu wake, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nitautia mikononi mwa mkuu kati ya mataifa. Yeye, atauadhibu. Nimeutupilia mbali kadiri ya uovu wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watu wa mataifa mengine katili kupindukia, wataukata na kuubwaga chini na kuuacha. Matawi yake yataanguka chini mlimani na kila mahali mabondeni; yatavunjika na kutapakaa chini katika magenge yote. Watu wote wataondoka kivulini mwake na kuuacha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndege wote watatua juu ya mabaki yake na wanyama wote wa porini watakanyaga matawi yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hayo yameupata ili mti wowote ulio mahali penye maji usiweze kurefuka tena kiasi hicho wala kukifikisha kilele chake mawinguni. Mti wowote unaonyweshwa maji usiweze tena kufikia urefu huo. Kwa maana kila kitu mwisho wake ni kifo; hali kadhalika na watu. Wote watashiriki hali yao washukao shimoni kwa wafu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kwa hiyo mimi Bwana Mwenyezi-Mungu nasema hivi: Siku ileile mwerezi ulipofika kuzimu nilitandaza giza nene juu yake nikaufunika; mito yake niliikausha na mtiririko wa maji yake mengi nikaukomesha. Nayo Lebanoni niliiweka gizani kwa ajili yake, na miti yote msituni ikazirai kwa ajili yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niliyafanya mataifa yatetemeke kwa sauti ya kuanguka kwake, naam, wakati nilipouangusha chini kuzimu pamoja nao washukao shimoni kwa wafu nayo miti yote ya Edeni, miti mizuri na ya pekee ya Lebanoni ambayo ilimwagiliwa maji ilifarijiwa huko chini kwa wafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyo nayo ilishuka huko kuzimu pamoja nao, ikajiunga na wale waliofungamana nao na ambao waliburudika chini ya kivuli chake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
